# Keep the checked reader artifact; ignore disposable TeX intermediates.
build/*
!build/caliber-paper.pdf

# Node dependencies for the diagram renderer; `make diagrams` installs them.
diagrams/node_modules/
__pycache__/

# Editor and OS noise.
*.swp
.DS_Store

# generated/ IS tracked on purpose, for two reasons:
#   * stats.tex records the counts the committed PDF was built from, so a reader can
#     see which tree revision the paper describes without re-running the generator.
#   * generated/diagrams/*.pdf are what an ordinary `make` consumes, which is what
#     keeps the paper buildable with nothing but pdflatex -- no Node, no npm.
# Regenerate with `make stats` and `make diagrams`.
#
# The intermediate scene JSON is build output, not an artifact worth reviewing.
generated/diagrams/*.scene.json
